{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15213280","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15213280","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:3:1521328001:0":{"text":"아버지, 물안개 영지에 가서 <style=\"highlight\">마르코</style>의 소식만 듣고 금방 돌아올게요!","source_cn":"阿爹，我只是想去水泽营地打听一下<style=high...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x40C7A1B2E36BFA50","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1521328002:0":{"text":"보칼리스인과 아쿠보르가 화해했으니 물안개 영지도 위험하지 않을 거예요!","source_cn":"呼临人已经和雅库伯尔和解了，水泽营地一点也不危险！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF28E930DE810B4C8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1521328003:0":{"text":"절대 안 된다! 분노의 골짜기에서 반 발짝도 나갈 수 없어!","source_cn":"绝对不行！你不许离开树怒山谷半步！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB5704234FAD9F129","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1521328004:0":{"text":"...아버지!","source_cn":"——阿爹！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x67181E68A65424FC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1521328005:0":{"text":"푸, 보칼리스인이라며. 네가 위험을 무릅쓸 가치가 없어.","source_cn":"芙，那是一个呼临人，不值得你为他冒险。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4AB3E32DAA1A0E2B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_fe